🛠️ Useful GPG commands

`gpg --list-keys`

`gpg --list-secret-keys`

`gpg --fingerprint`

`gpg --import key.asc`

`gpg --encrypt --recipient <key> file.txt`

`gpg --decrypt file.txt.gpg`

`gpg --verify file.sig file.txt`

Key takeaway:
As a DevOps engineer, knowing PGP is not just about encryption. You should also understand how to troubleshoot keys, integrate PGP with CI/CD, manage secrets securely, and handle key rotation in production.
